#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/RolePlay/scenarios/custom-conversation.ts:114
msgid ""
"Create a unique, personalized setting that fits your specific interests or challenges. This scenario lets you define the context, roles, tone, and goals of the conversation you want to practice.\n"
"\n"
"## Why You Should Play *Your Custom Scenario*\n"
"1. Practice situations that match your real life, work, travel, or personal goals.  \n"
"2. Control who the AI is and how the conversation feels.  \n"
"3. Focus on the outcome you want, not just general speaking practice.  \n"
"4. Adjust the difficulty and tone to match your confidence level.  \n"
"5. Prepare for conversations that standard role-plays may never cover.\n"
"\n"
"## How the Scenario Works\n"
"You describe the situation, choose roles, set the goal, and optionally add extra details. The AI will then create a conversation that follows your setup and behaves according to the tone and difficulty you selected.\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Lag en unik, personlig setting som passer dine spesifikke interesser eller utfordringer. Dette scenariet lar deg definere konteksten, rollene, tonen og målene for samtalen du ønsker å øve på.\n"
"\n"
"## Hvorfor Du Bør Spille *Ditt Eget Scenario*\n"
"1. Øv på situasjoner som samsvarer med ditt ekte liv, arbeid, reise eller personlige mål.  \n"
"2. Kontroller hvem AI-en er og hvordan samtalen føles.  \n"
"3. Fokuser på resultatet du ønsker, ikke bare generell taletrening.  \n"
"4. Juster vanskelighetsgrad og tone for å passe med ditt selvtillitsnivå.  \n"
"5. Forbered deg på samtaler som standard rollespill kanskje aldri dekker.\n"
"\n"
"## Hvordan Scenariet Fungerer\n"
"Du beskriver situasjonen, velger roller, setter målet, og kan eventuelt legge til ekstra detaljer. AI-en vil deretter lage en samtale som følger ditt oppsett og oppfører seg i henhold til den tonen og vanskelighetsgraden du har valgt."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/RolePlay/scenarios/buying-a-train-ticket.ts:7
msgid "Buying a Train Ticket"
msgstr "Kjøpe en Togbillett"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/RolePlay/scenarios/buying-a-train-ticket.ts:8
msgid "Ticket"
msgstr "Billett"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/RolePlay/scenarios/buying-a-train-ticket.ts:10
msgid ""
"Get comfortable purchasing travel tickets in a bustling train station scenario. Perfect for practicing how to ask about routes, departure times, and ticket types.\n"
"\n"
"## Why You Should Play *Buying a Train Ticket*\n"
"1. Gain confidence asking about schedules, prices, and possible discounts.  \n"
"2. Learn essential travel vocabulary, including ticket options and train routes.  \n"
"3. Practice navigating public transportation systems in a realistic setting.  \n"
"4. Become better at clarifying details and handling unexpected changes.  \n"
"5. Build the practical language skills you need for smooth, stress-free travel.\n"
"\n"
"## How the Scenario Works\n"
"In this scenario, you’ll step into the role of a traveler looking to buy a ticket. The AI takes on the role of a train station ticket agent, asking you where you’re headed, when you’re departing, and what type of ticket you need. By interacting with the AI, you’ll master the art of asking the right questions and understanding key information about your journey.\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Get comfortable purchasing travel tickets in a bustling train station scenario. Perfect for practicing how to ask about routes, departure times, and ticket types.\n"
"\n"
"## Why You Should Play *Buying a Train Ticket*\n"
"1. Gain confidence asking about schedules, prices, and possible discounts.  \n"
"2. Learn essential travel vocabulary, including ticket options and train routes.  \n"
"3. Practice navigating public transportation systems in a realistic setting.  \n"
"4. Become better at clarifying details and handling unexpected changes.  \n"
"5. Build the practical language skills you need for smooth, stress-free travel.\n"
"\n"
"## How the Scenario Works\n"
"In this scenario, you’ll step into the role of a traveler looking to buy a ticket. The AI takes on the role of a train station ticket agent, asking you where you’re headed, when you’re departing, and what type of ticket you need. By interacting with the AI, you’ll master the art of asking the right questions and understanding key information about your journey."

